SPOILER FOLLOWS: (taming monsters)




























Cats and dogs may be tamed by throwing food at them.  Not all types of
food will work, but most food rations, tripe rations and fresh uncursed
corpses will work.
Most monsters can be tamed with a scroll of taming.
A leash can be used on a tame monster.  Move next to your monster and 
apply the leash.  (Apply again to un-leash it.)  Leashed monster(s)  will always
follow you, even when you teleport or steps on a trapdoor.    
If you have many leashes, you may leash many monsters.  This is impractical in corridors, but useful if you tries to bring a lot of monster down to
the next level.  
